json.library/JsonCount                                  json.library/JsonCount

   NAME
        JsonCount -- How many members (0.1).

   SYNOPSIS
        count = JsonCount(node)
        D0                A0

        LONG JsonCount(JsonNode *);

   FUNCTION
        Returns how many members an object or array has.

