json.library/JsonType                                    json.library/JsonType

   NAME
        JsonType -- What a node is (0.1).

   SYNOPSIS
        type = JsonType(node)
        D0              A0

        LONG JsonType(JsonNode *);

   FUNCTION
        Returns the node's type.

   INPUTS
        node - any node, or NULL

   RESULT
        type - JT_OBJECT, JT_ARRAY, JT_STRING, JT_NUMBER, JT_BOOL, JT_NULL,
